```js
   var merged = {};
   ... copy top-level ...
   merged.params = mergedParams;
   for (var i = 0; i < mergePaths.length; i++) {
       ...
       setPathValue(merged, mergePaths[i], combined);
   }
   return merged;
``

Let me fix by reordering: do the array merge AFTER constructing merged. Rewrite the whole block cleanly.

